              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LESLIE30"
            },
            "reviewBody": "in the past i've enjoyed eating shoofly pies which were made by the amish &amp; pennsylvania dutch. a simple, no frills pie, this recipe comes pretty close to how i remember them tasting. note: we prefer our shoofly pie served warm. it is also good with a scoop of vanilla ice cream on top (optional). thanks for the yummy recipe &amp; the history lesson robert!",
